{"id":"n85002-3-6","stage":3,"title":"해치다 · 害","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n85002-3-6-1","ko":"우리 동네에서 살인 사건 일어났대.","zh":"听说我们小区发生了杀人案。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"동네에서","meaning":"小区，社区，村庄","explanation":"동네：小区，社区，村庄；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"동네","audio":"/audio/f97ccdfe641c28373e6c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62417","senseId":"2","lemma":"동네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"동네에서","audio":"/audio/9b5567575ddda2bf9fb0.mp3"}},{"text":"살인","meaning":"杀人","explanation":"살인：杀人","readings":[{"term":"살인","audio":"/audio/33b6e2db7d5921404293.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14244","senseId":"1","lemma":"살인","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"살인","audio":"/audio/33b6e2db7d5921404293.mp3"}},{"text":"사건","meaning":"事件，案件","explanation":"사건：事件，案件","readings":[{"term":"사건","audio":"/audio/d04be92d4a8150be63c8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15654","senseId":"1","lemma":"사건","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사건","audio":"/audio/d04be92d4a8150be63c8.mp3"}},{"text":"일어났대.","meaning":"发生，起","explanation":"일어나다：发生，起；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；대：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"일어나다","audio":"/audio/d57c47b0949440ff623b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71696","senseId":"3","lemma":"일어나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일어났대","audio":"/audio/e039baf04fd5bd921118.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"f97ccdfe641c2837","term":"동네","zh":"小区，社区，村庄","audio":"/audio/f97ccdfe641c28373e6c.mp3","entryId":"62417","definition":"多户人家聚集在一起生活的地方。","pronunciation":["동ː네"]},{"id":"33b6e2db7d592140","term":"살인","zh":"杀人","audio":"/audio/33b6e2db7d5921404293.mp3","entryId":"14244","definition":"将人杀死的行为。","pronunciation":["사린"]},{"id":"d04be92d4a8150be","term":"사건","zh":"事件，案件","audio":"/audio/d04be92d4a8150be63c8.mp3","entryId":"15654","definition":"能够引发关心或瞩目的事情。","pronunciation":["사ː껀"]},{"id":"d57c47b0949440ff","term":"일어나다","zh":"发生，起","audio":"/audio/d57c47b0949440ff623b.mp3","entryId":"71696","definition":"事情或事件等产生。","pronunciation":["이러나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e92ad4d811150a7a5b6b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n85002-3-6-2","ko":"어떻게 사람이 사람을 해칠 수가 있지? 정말 무섭다.","zh":"人怎么可能会伤害另一个人呢？真是可怕。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떻게","audio":"/audio/64e493d09f1b306ade0c.mp3"}},{"text":"사람이","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람이","audio":"/audio/3f33d9d6ca9be288c4e3.mp3"}},{"text":"사람을","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"1","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람을","audio":"/audio/e4ea86ef494eafea0006.mp3"}},{"text":"해칠","meaning":"害","explanation":"해치다：害；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"해치다","audio":"/audio/875ff71edd73e776fa0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85002","senseId":"3","lemma":"해치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해칠","audio":"/audio/58f6b29518414d993f67.mp3"}},{"text":"수가","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수가","audio":"/audio/6780a417c9a853af476b.mp3"}},{"text":"있지?","meaning":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","explanation":"있다：能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"5","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있지","audio":"/audio/6af127780f763fcd960b.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"무섭다.","meaning":"可怕，恐怖，畏惧","explanation":"무섭다：可怕，恐怖，畏惧；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"무섭다","audio":"/audio/6c5692ebced898c0376c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55637","senseId":"2","lemma":"무섭다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무섭다","audio":"/audio/6c5692ebced898c0376c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"可以思考，会制造并使用语言和工具、构成社会而生活的存在。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"875ff71edd73e776","term":"해치다","zh":"害","audio":"/audio/875ff71edd73e776fa0e.mp3","entryId":"85002","definition":"使受伤或死亡。","pronunciation":["해ː치다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"6c5692ebced898c0","term":"무섭다","zh":"可怕，恐怖，畏惧","audio":"/audio/6c5692ebced898c0376c.mp3","entryId":"55637","definition":"难以面对或想逃避某个人或某种状况。","pronunciation":["무섭따"]}],"audio":"/audio/bd1bd6e18f397db8e8e2.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.805,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=85002","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"중급","day":98,"sequenceScore":2.6317,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["人怎么可能会伤害另一个人呢？真是可怕。","听说我们小区发生了杀人案。","我觉得，有一个相处得非常好的朋友，比有十个亲戚还要让人羡慕呢。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["听说我们小区发生了杀人案。","我觉得，有一个相处得非常好的朋友，比有十个亲戚还要让人羡慕呢。","人怎么可能会伤害另一个人呢？真是可怕。"],"answer":2}]}
